    "title": "St. Louis County to launch largest Depot renovation in 50 years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By EDITORIAL POLICIES ,\n7 hours ago St. Louis County will begin the largest renovation of The Depot in more than 50 years with a public kickoff event March 3 in Duluth. County officials and tenant organizations will host a community celebration, “Legacy in Motion,” at 5 p.m. in the Great Hall of the St. Louis County Heritage and Arts Center, widely known as The Depot. The public is invited. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
